      "課程學制": "碩士在職專班",
      "學分": "3",
      "課程目標": "\"As enterprise worldwide strive for real time management, quick responses from managers become mandate for many enterprises. To help managers make quick responses, however, information has to be ready quickly, too. The maturity of ERP systems establishes a foundation for providing the raw data for the responsiveness. However, the data in ERP systems along with data in other systems has to be cleaned, extracted, and loaded to a system that can effectively store the unified data and has user-friendly interface to produce managerial reports. The system is called Data Warehouse or Business Intelligence. With the advance of big data era, the need for a Business Intelligence is prevail in almost every organization. The course is intended to introduce SAP BIW and some part of HANA to business majored students. The content includes modeling, some ETL and query reporting tools of SAP BIW. Students should be able to get first-hand experience on how to build models, load data and place queries in a SAP BIW. Students will also learn the basic architecture of SAP HANA and some of the basic modeling concept of SAP HANA. Students will need to do projects based on the system introduced in the class.\"",
      "授課內容": "\"Introduction of dimensional Model\nImplementing dimensional Model on SAP BIW\nSAP ETL process\nSAP query designers\nIntroduction of SAP BW/4 Hana\"",
